WEBVTT

00:12:56.750 --> 00:13:00.783
(Recording) David Sedaris: Be yourself,
unless your self is an asshole.

00:13:00.807 --> 00:13:02.918
(Audience laughs)

00:13:03.710 --> 00:13:05.437
Herminia Ibarra: One of the problems

00:13:05.461 --> 00:13:07.766
with the "bring your whole
self to work" framing

00:13:07.790 --> 00:13:09.516
is that it's narcissistic.

00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:12.781
What about taking an interest
in the other person?

00:13:12.805 --> 00:13:15.388
Herminia Ibarra is
an organizational behavior professor

00:13:15.412 --> 00:13:16.656
at London Business School.

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:19.476
She's a leading expert
on authenticity at work.

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:20.977
HI: Authentic leadership,

00:13:21.001 --> 00:13:23.186
which I actually traced in the press

00:13:23.210 --> 00:13:26.606
and kind of saw the line
go up exponentially,

00:13:26.630 --> 00:13:30.944
really has become a very popular notion.